      "reply": {
        "answer": "A VORTAC is a ground navigation aid that gives VOR azimuth, TACAN azimuth, and TACAN distance. It uses paired VHF and UHF bands, and a TACAN-equipped aircraft receives distance from it automatically because the VOR and TACAN channels are paired so that azimuth and distance come from the same station.",
